                        "version": 0,
                        "content": "The nurse is creating a plan of care for a client with a stroke (brain attack) who has right homonymous hemianopsia. Which would the nurse include in the plan of care for the client?",
                        "subjectId": "ad5ab04c79144c0ea9b83385308c3b1d",
                        "difficultyIds": "49d86bb4d5071eb7de614d6c79f7abfb",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Creating创新",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nHomonymous hemianopsia is a loss of half of the visual field. The nurse instructs the client to scan the environment and stands within the client's intact field of vision. The nurse would not patch the eye because the client does not have double vision. The client would have objects placed in the intact fields of vision, and the nurse needs to approach the client from the intact side.",
                        "id": "00226276bb0544d2abd87e9282ca4ecf",
                        "mark": "0",
                        "collectionState": "0"
                    },
                    {
                        "optionList": [
                            {
                                "isRight": "1",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "bfdea1c551df487480be9229f025fde4",
                                "content": "Assist the client to eat with the left hand to build strength."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "09ddd2a34947408887d1d0f9585feeb4",
                                "content": "Provide a pureed diet that is easy for the client to swallow."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "31e57c3b2a7b475b98258b582b266b7b",
                                "content": "Inform the client that a feeding tube will be placed if progress is not made."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "a6249e3b24124e04bcc5d6375472cc10",
                                "content": "Provide a variety of foods on the meal tray to stimulate the client's appetite."
                            }
                        ],
                        "extJson": {
                            "optionList": [
                                {
                                    "isRight": "1",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "bfdea1c551df487480be9229f025fde4",
